┌── Log ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│           He sits down on the chopping block to get his breath, and his hand goes into his coat  │
│           and comes out with a letter. It has been folded and unfolded more than once.           │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Peddler brought it last night, after you'd gone to bed. I should have woken you. ...I  │
│           didn't.                                                                                │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           No name on it. "Get out of the march. Tonight. They are coming for everyone who was    │
│           there that night. Burn this."                                                          │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Ellery                                                                                 │
│           Dace.                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│ ▶         Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Aye. That's the boy's hand. I sat behind it while it learned its letters, same table   │
│           as yours.                                                                              │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Hollis Marr                                                                            │
│           Everyone who was there. Four of us, at that mill. My girl's dead. So that's you and    │
│           me, and him, writing letters.                                                          │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│           Ellery                                                                                 │
│           > Four years, and this is the letter I get.                                            │
│                                                                                                  │
│                                                                                                  │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────── arrows move · f go to this line · d close ──┘
